                                "sense_id": "93cca46a-fb71-303c-9d35-c51060c160dc",
                                "text": "In one week, my house was made weather-tight, and thoroughly cleansed from top to bottom […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fbf2c6c-5407-42dd-bbf1-cc699559abe9",
                                "sense_id": "93cca46a-fb71-303c-9d35-c51060c160dc",
                                "text": "There's a rubble-stone / Unfit for the front o’ the building, stuff to stow / In a gap behind and keep us weather-tight; / There’s porphyry for the prominent place. Good lack!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5291460-7a5b-4edf-a2e2-a3267acfd062",
                                "sense_id": "93cca46a-fb71-303c-9d35-c51060c160dc",
                                "text": "Their brownstone still stands, and it is still snug and weathertight."
                            }
                        ]
